{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1774312756,"nonce":"ngCn/Wem5+ng2f+KrkeEyioUAD4=","message":"**Implementation spec**\n\n**Goal**: Move AnalysisLibrary from top Sidebar to a new left-side sidebar within the BottomShelf, visible only when the Analysis tab is active.\n\n**Changes**:\n\n1. **layoutStore.ts** — Add `bottomSidebarWidth`, `bottomSidebarCollapsed`, `toggleBottomSidebar()`, `setBottomSidebarWidth()`. Reuse same min/max/default width constants as top sidebar.\n\n2. **BottomSidebar.tsx** (new) — Left sidebar in the bottom pane content area.\n   - Visual language: identical to top Sidebar (`border-r border-slate-100 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm`, 1px resize handle with brand hover color, collapse/expand toggle using `PanelLeftOpen`/`PanelLeftClose` icons).\n   - Renders `\u003cAnalysisLibrary /\u003e` as its content.\n   - Resize: pointer drag on right edge, same pattern as Sidebar.tsx.\n   - Collapse: toggle button in header, same pattern as Sidebar.tsx.\n\n3. **BottomShelf.tsx** — When `activeTab === 'analysis'`, wrap content area in a flex row: `\u003cBottomSidebar /\u003e` + canvas. Other tabs render without sidebar.\n\n4. **Sidebar.tsx** — Remove 'analyses' tab button and `AnalysisLibrary` rendering. `ActiveTab` becomes `'components' | 'tasks'`. Add comment about future reunification.\n\n5. **Drag-and-drop**: No changes needed — AnalysisLibrary already sets `application/feedbax-analysis` drag data, and AnalysisCanvas reads it. Moving AnalysisLibrary to a different DOM location does not affect this.","files":null}]}